00:36:49,548 --> 00:36:51,849
And the reason for this is that the closer we get to the present,

643
00:36:51,909 --> 00:36:55,671
the more we know about the time periods, because the less time there has been

644
00:36:55,951 --> 00:36:59,793
for the rocks and the fossils to be destroyed in the course of time.

645
00:36:59,813 --> 00:37:02,014
-The easier it is to find stuff. -Yes.

646
00:37:02,704 --> 00:37:07,226
So the Cenozoic is split into two periods, the Paleogene and the Neogene,

